<section class="page admin-home"><span class="eyebrow"><%= demo_mode? ? "Admin demo workspace" : "Administrator workspace" %></span><h1>Bring people together.</h1><p class="intro">Shape an event, review every detail and preview its place in the community.</p><% if demo_mode? %><div class="admin-demo-note">Local demo workspace · publication changes this preview only.</div><% end %><div class="admin-create"><h2>Your next event</h2><p>Start with the details. Find the right words. See it as your members will.</p><%= link_to new_admin_event_path, class: "primary full" do %>Create an event <%= isp_icon "plus-lg" %><% end %></div>
  <section class="admin-event-list"><div class="section-head"><h2>Your events</h2><span class="count-badge"><%= @events.size %></span></div><% @events.each do |event| %><article class="admin-event-row"><div><span class="status-badge <%= event.published? ? 'published' : 'draft' %>"><%= event.published? ? (demo_mode? ? "Published in demo · v#{event.published_revision}" : "Published · v#{event.published_revision}") : "Draft · private" %></span><h3><%= event.title %></h3><p>Draft revision <%= event.revision %><%= " · #{event.preview_current? ? 'Preview ready' : 'Preview needed'}" %></p></div><div class="actions"><%= link_to "Member interests", admin_event_interests_path(event), class: "link-button" %><%= link_to "Edit draft", edit_admin_event_path(event), class: "link-button" %><% if event.published? %><%= link_to "View public event", event_path(event), class: "link-button" %><% end %></div></article><% end %></section>
</section>
